#Linear Regression 

🟢 First ML Problem (Very Easy)
📌 Problem:

👉 Predict marks based on hours studied

Hours	Marks
1	    35
2	    45
3	    55
4	    65
5	    75

#CODE:

import pandas as pd
from sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression
df = pd.DataFrame({
    "hours" : [1,2,3,4,5],
    "marks" : [35,45,55,65,75]
})
x = df[["hours"]]
y = df["marks"]

model = LinearRegression()
model.fit(x,y)
print(model.predict([[6]]))
print(model.predict([[7]]))
print(model.predict([[8]]))

